{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52396","headline":"回波乐 三十九 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 三十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"学问莫倚聪明，打却我慢贡高。\n出家解脱无年（项校「事」），永离三界逍遥。\n坐禅解空无相，皆皆实觅□□。\n□□□□□□，□□□□□□。\n法界以爲家舍，任从自在条条（项校「翛翛」）。\n形（下缺）。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52396.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52396","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}